Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1055-1056] End of Wano 03 - New Era.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tastes so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!\NI found a shaved ice stall over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaved ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna try shaved ice, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, O-Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami-chan, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're so many flavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna try the oshiruko flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Annoying scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see no end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!\NI will lend you aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why?!\NWhy will you not allow me to fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mustn't!\NYou must not lay your hand upon him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just bring Straw Hat Luffy\Nto me already, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja Art: Scrolling Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burn to ash...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy filth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Firebreak Forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell could I possibly serve\Nas a Navy Admiral...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...with such an obvious weakness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water's important for\Nnature and humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foul beast! Cut as we might,\Nthey keep growing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:34.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he-gara have no weakness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we really gotta cut\Nall o' them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you sniff us out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You weren't with the others.\NOf course I'd find that suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about me like\NI'm some hyena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:28.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis moldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:35.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told neither Kaido\Nnor Orochi of this route...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But as the All-Star Jack is a Fishman,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they found the Poneglyph in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How would being\Na Fishman help find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best to see for oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:52.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how deep are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Centuries into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Tengu-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What might be\Nthe source of this dim light?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A block of glass is installed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peer through it,\Nif you so wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have reached the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano...\Non the seafloor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the Land of Wano,\Neight hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or rather, what once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:07:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Eight hundred years ago"\NWhat do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis precisely as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:06.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I know not what transpired\Nto have caused what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And as that is not seawater in which it lies,\Nit is relatively well-preserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what I know:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:21.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano was once located\Nat a base of a great mountain named Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At one point walls were built,\Nenclosing the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,causing rainwater to accumulate over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People abandoned these\Nnow-uninhabitable towns,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,moved up the mountain,\Nand founded a new country...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's the current Land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Road Poneglyph...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This makes three,\NI do believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we find the one remaining,\Nwe can reach Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We tread upon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the high ground in a cave\Nat the foot of Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:22.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(338,487)}Current\NLocation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what is more, so they say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Ancient Weapon Pluton\Nlies deeper still!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have never seen it myself,\Nnot that I could even show it to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To retrieve it requires\Ndismantling of the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, to "open the borders" would mean\Ndestroying the defensive walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and unleashing the Ancient Weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Opening the borders\Nmeans unleashing the weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would Kozuki Oden\Nhave wanted to do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the sum of what has been\Nhanded down within the Shogunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know nothing of what\NOden discovered abroad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yum, mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was a shaved ice stall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Shaved ice?!\NWhere?! Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave this place at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mere humans're no match\Nfor Mother Nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ya get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Kaido were here, I wouldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to admit it,\Nbut Kaido's sheer dominance...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kept this country's enemies at bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can understand that much,\Nyou'll bring Straw Hat Luffy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:22.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon as I lop off his head,\NI'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!\NLet us turn to Luffy and his crew for aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They will not lose to this fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we will not accept aid from you, either!\NDo not aid us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were imprisoned within Onigashima for so long,\Nand now you can finally be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so, I will give you\Na proper send-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For too long have I been dependent upon\NLuffy, Zoro, and their allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If those of us that remain in this country\Ncannot drive out our enemies...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we rely on those\Nwho will be departing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will have proven our inability...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to defend our land in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Begone, foul creature of wood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why can I not bring it forth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow...\NHe's kinda like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knew there was\Nsuch a worthless dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing, 'tis practically as Kaido's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out, and begone from our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now hold on, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible! He has mastered\Nhis dragon form!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, his aim is not the most steady...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oopsie daisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tryin' to burn down\Nthe whole damn village, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want a fight,\NI'll give ya a fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frickin' Kaido wannabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna skewer ya,\Nmouth to tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't move...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whose the hell is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Red Hair Pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya can't just whip out your Haki like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too hard on our new crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you it's unfair, Navy dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But going after these exhausted "sprouts"\Njust after they changed pirate history...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is a bit tasteless, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The new era really\Nscaring you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to fight your bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did it, Momonosuke-kun!\NYou drove him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You defended Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I defended Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I defended my country!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are incredible, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good on ya, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess we don't get a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell of a Haki that was, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kinda made me think of\Na familiar face...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1692,246)}Flower\NCapital
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1692,424)}After the\Nparty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-san!\NYou must live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe\NRaizo and Shinobu wasted away like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most terrifying sorcery, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frustrating as it is,\Nhe spoke the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido served as a deterrent\Nagainst enemies of this nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis my shame to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was in Kuri,\Nand as a result knew nothing of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't yer fault,\Nwasn't much harm done besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An' it's all thanks ta\NMomonosuke-sama's huge hand in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So don'cha worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way,\Nhow's O-Tsuru-san these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... Okobore Town\Ncaught fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and she suffered horrible burns,\Nyet she survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, O-Tsuru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard Kin-san came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, he has.\NHe already returned to the capital, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're from the capital, too.\NYou ought to go back for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would much like to be with him, to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, my... Even twenty years later,\NTsuru has retained her beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Dogs like cheese,\Nbut not that much cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prrmeow meowmeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How wonderful, Kin-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is the matter, Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to be popular, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gara need to\Nrecuperate first, Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is big monkeyin' news!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Want shome oden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duke Inuarashi and Governor Nekomamushi\Nare howlin' for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up?\NYou rang?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duke? Governor Nekomamushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We was waitin' for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(879,699)}Inuarashi's Three Musketeers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:18:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were thinking of having you gara succeed us\Nas ruler of the Mokomo Dukedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruler?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kay, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ruler?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dun wanna!\NThere's no way I can handle that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the cat and I have decided to stay here in Wano,\Nand as samurai of the Kozuki Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we will protect Momonosuke-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prrmeow meowmeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gara went abroad with Luffy's crew,\Nsomethin' few've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we's sure ya got what it takes\Nt'lead the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're so many others\Nthat're stronger than me, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To guard the country\Nis our job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll support you, too.\NThis is what the Duke and the Governor decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:14.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot! Most of all of us, you-gara carry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Pedro's will in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:24.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest's up to yous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zou's now in\Nyou-gara youngsters' hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You speak the truth...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are our grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Oden's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you really were alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could not bear to\Nshow my face to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could not save Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...much less could I save our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For that, I am sorry!\NSo sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How I longed to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As did I!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:07.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the very image of\NOden himself, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For us, having lost our parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,simply knowing we have\Nliving relatives gives us great courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So please, do not apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was astonished!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he was Sukiyaki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not once did\Nthe thought cross my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My heart leapt into my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am ever grateful\Nthat he yet lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew you lot would\Ncertainly take notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:21:00.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would wear a tengu mask\Nwhen there is no festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did not think you\Na mere swordsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We felt it would be rude\Nto draw attention to the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.59,0:21:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you agree, Kin-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed so!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I regret to have had you\Ntreat the issue so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can impart to you our land's history,\Nbut seeing as I am but a doddering old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that is the extent of\Nwhat I am able to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, do not tell our subjects of me.\NLet me live out the rest of my days in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From this point onward,\Nthe new era is yours to shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just the fact that you are alive\Ngives us strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say whaaaa?!\NPluton's in this country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. I didn't get to see it, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's here, for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:22:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing really exists, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:05.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't that the thing Franky\Nhad the blueprints to 'n burned 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.99,0:22:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Ancient Weapon,\Nbearing the name of a god:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want it for yourself, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, I dun need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet, Oden attempted to unleash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What?\NThe bad guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you likening mature women...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to devastating weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you\Ns'posed to be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who am I you ask?\NDo you not recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.14,0:22:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A minor incident may have\Ncaused a little emaciation...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but 'tis I, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:49.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That little bit of\Nemaciation did wonders!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look so incredible,\NI've lost my backbone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I'm all bones to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.04,0:23:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan took me in\Nas her apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'mma get stronger,\Nso's the next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want ya to lemme join yer crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:12.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If ya can use\Nninja arts by then,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.51,0:23:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awwright!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put in hard work 'n\Nbecome a bewitchin' ninja lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nin, nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oooh, you're such a cutie, O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the bestest!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.53,0:23:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...\NPluton's in Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First Poseidon, and now this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know someone who'll be\Nthrilled to hear about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:46.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1677,322)}A few\Ndays\Nlater
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.56,0:24:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The regions have submitted their\Nindividual reconstruction plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us see...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the funding estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.87,0:24:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Proposals to repurpose\Nthe weapon factory sites have come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm... Let us go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shogun! I humbly request\Nyour opinion on the reservoir later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must talk about the\Nall-region meeting with the Daimyos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.19,0:24:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.37,0:25:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might you teach me some\Nof your sword tech...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.33,0:25:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...niques...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.26,0:25:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:16.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopperemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.89,0:25:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.85,0:25:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonekichi! Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.19,0:25:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.07,0:25:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori! Have you seen\NLuffy and the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have departed after\Nbidding their farewells to everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.74,0:25:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Bidding their farewells"...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet they said\Nnothing of this to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.75,0:25:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.76,0:25:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ki-Kin'emon!\NLuffy and his crew have...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.34,0:26:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have just learned\Nof this as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You, too, Kin'emon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I inquired, and Denjiro and the others\Nhave already bade them farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did they not\Nsay anything to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.57,0:26:19.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1671,273)}Tokage\NPort\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.33,0:26:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pick another date, Straw Hatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.41,0:26:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell do I gotta?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.62,0:26:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause it's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Settin' sail together, I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.50,0:26:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The alliance is done!\NWe're enemies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.09,0:26:40.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My crew decided we'd set off today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.55,0:26:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.97,0:26:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You change first, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.27,0:26:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about I not,\Nand you take your own advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't changin', neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.73,0:26:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like we all tried\Nto pick the same day...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.57,0:26:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we're pickin'\Nseparate directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose locked on\Nto three directions...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.74,0:27:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Northeast, east, and southeast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.87,0:27:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Northeast! The middle one! The middle one!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.25,0:27:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm set, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.17,0:27:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heading northeast\Nwill get you the farthest ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe try using your brains once in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.34,0:27:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The middle one"...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That settles my destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two can figure out\Nthe rest on your own, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, pick one!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.73,0:27:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of 'em says "East"!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.27,0:27:35.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got "East"!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.28,0:27:44.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I picked the loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.24,0:27:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.83,0:27:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's danger no matter\Nwhich way, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Literally nobody cares!\NJust help with the cargo, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an Emperor of the Sea,\Nbut I lost the raffle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cry more,\Nwhy don'cha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.09,0:28:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...when it comes to Emperors,\Nthe one who really makes me mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.14,0:28:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Genius Jester!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuuh?!\NThe heck's up with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those're Crocodile and\NHawkeye, ain't they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.25,0:28:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why're they showin' up like\Nthey're under Buggy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.41,0:28:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, there's no way\NHawkeye'd work for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.55,0:28:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If these two men are actually\Nunder his command,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.55,0:28:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then he's definitely earned the right\Nto be called an Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's a total dumbass!\NWhat the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like this company\Ncalled Cross Guild...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...started putting bounties on marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy were the hunters this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:29:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but now they gotta worry about\Nbeing hunted by civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While we were holed up\Nin this isolated country,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:09.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the world's changed a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No complaints about\Nour directions, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:18.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon as we sail outta here,\Nit's back to bein' a free-for-all!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.09,0:29:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Copy of a Road Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've earned your right to it,\Nsame as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cheating takes all the fun out of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.10,0:29:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Kaido did have one, as I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same kinda thing that we got from\None of Big Mom's generals?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.69,0:29:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better get serious about this too, Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we wanna be in the running\Nfor the One Piece...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.24,0:29:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to find\N"the Man with the Burn Scar", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.91,0:29:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we hardly got any leads...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.96,0:30:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Burn Scar"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.59,0:30:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Works out for us, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.76,0:30:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?!\NSpit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.31,0:30:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.10,0:30:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you not here, either?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.78,0:30:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.45,0:30:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.24,0:30:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your usual spot on the roof, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.37,0:30:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, then!\NI have decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.55,0:30:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us go to where\NLuffy and his crew are!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...shall live as Kozuki Oden did!
